# Draft PRs = no checks

| State | Actions | Vercel |
|-------|---------|--------|
| **draft** | Skipped (`ci.yml` `if`) | Ignore cancela cualquier Git build (ambos proyectos) |
| **ready** | lint/typecheck only | No feature preview (`deploymentEnabled` all false + ignore) |
| push `development` | Runs CI only | No Vercel deploy |
| push `main` | CI + Deploy workflow | Auto-deploy off; Actions ships **prod** + **demo** (`rocha-cotizador-dev`) |

## Agent

- Always `gh pr create --draft` unless user says otherwise in that message
- Never `gh pr ready` / undraft unless user ordered it
- Draft: do not wait on `gh pr checks` (skipped on purpose)
- Ready: wait `gh pr checks` — `lint-and-typecheck` only (ignore Vercel Git cancel en feature PRs)
- Git auto-deploy off for all branches (`vercel.json` `deploymentEnabled`); ignore script cancels residual Git builds

Refs: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`, `scripts/vercel-ignore-draft-pr.sh`, `docs/ci.md`
